It will never be safe to pray until you make your diety
happy with you not angry with you.  Small monsters will
not do this.  You must sacrafice powerfull monsters.
Monsters powerfull enough to reduces your diety's anger
almost certainly will not be created on level 1.

So it is time to start exploring deeper.  You will not
have the option or praying to get out of trouble so be
carefull.  Note the location of every altar but only
sacrfice at the co-aligned ones.  Eventually you will
find one deep enough that you can sacrafice a powerful
monster there.  Prod a dragon or wumpus or mumak to the
altar, kill it there, sacrafice it.  You'll feel partially
absolved and make some progress or you will become
reconciled and you will be able to pray again.

Lesson learned - Do not pray until allowed.  The effects
can last for a dozen levels.

